qualquer tipo de comando!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/517330/extras/b432173abf1d88aee08d28504006fc25.avif?t=1751299424\" width=613 height=97 /></span></li></ul>",
